[ti:Visitor song]
[ar:nishal21 and visitors]
[00:00.00]Someone stopped by late on a quiet night
[00:04.94]left a single note and went on their way
[00:09.78]I never got their name until the credits
[00:14.60]now it plays here every single day
[00:19.06]I was painting a picture (@nishal21)
[00:24.88]One note at a time
[00:28.94]from people passing through
[00:34.30]a name beside a line
[00:37.50]and part of it is you
[00:53.86]Leave yours and the song gets one beat longer
